===Arena of Destiny===
Introduced in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] and unlocked after clearing [[A New Legend]]. Each stage has a score bonus condition that grants more points from using certain [[Special Abilities|abilities]] than killing enemies. More points will be awarded for units with fewer target Traits (not counting those gained from [[Talents]]). Enemies drop money, and the base is a [[Talent Orb Castle (Enemy Base)|Talent Orb Castle]]. The rewards for this Dojo are Treasure Chests, which contain [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orbs]].

