==Trivia==
*On the initial release of the first three Ranking Dojo stages, it cost 1 Cat Food to enter an Arena of Honor stage, this was changed in Version 6.6.
*At some point in June 2023, Arena of Honor displayed a 0 star difficulty on the map selection screen. However, in around [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]], it was removed for unknown reasons.

